tainer\">\r\n            <div class=\"hero-content text-center\">\r\n                <h1 class=\"display-4 text-white\">Airport Pickup Guidelines</h1>\r\n                <p class=\"lead text-white-50\">Ensuring a smooth and seamless start to your journey.</p>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n\r\n    <section class=\"content-section py-5\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-10\">\r\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title-static\">Your Arrival Process</h2>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-secondary\">To ensure a hassle-free pickup experience, please follow the guidelines below upon your arrival at the airport.</p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-4\">1. After Landing</h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-secondary\">Once you have disembarked from your flight, please proceed through immigration, collect your luggage from the baggage claim area, and clear customs.</p>\r\n\r\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-4\">2. Meeting Your Driver</h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-secondary\">Your dedicated driver will be waiting for you in the arrivals hall, just after you exit the customs area. They will be holding a sign with your name clearly displayed on it. Please look for this sign.</p>\r\n\r\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-4\">3. In Case You Cannot Find Your Driver</h3>\r\n                    <p class=\"text-secondary\">While it is rare, if for any reason you cannot locate your driver, please do not leave the arrivals hall. Instead, please contact our 24/7 customer support line immediately at <strong class=\"text-warning\">+966 56 547 6113</strong> or via WhatsApp at <strong class=\"text-warning\">+966 56 547 6113</strong>. Our team will assist you in connecting with your driver right away.</p>\r\n                    \r\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-4\">Important Notes</h3>\r\n                     <ul class=\"text-secondary\">\r\n                        <li>Please have your booking confirmation details ready.</li>\r\n                        <li>We monitor all flight arrivals, so we will be aware of any delays. You do not need to inform us if your flight is delayed.</li>\r\n                        <li>The complimentary waiting time is 90 minutes from the time your flight lands.</li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </section>\r\n    \r\n<!-- Main Footer Section -->\r\n    <footer class=\"main-site-footer\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"row gy-4\">\r\n                <!-- Company Info Column -->\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6\">\r\n                    <a class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3\" href=\"/\"\r\n                        style=\"gap: 12px; text-decoration: none;\">\r\n                        <img src=\"/img/LOGO.png\" alt=\"AL HARMAIN UMRAH TRANSPORT Logo\"\r\n                            style=\"height: 60px; width: auto; max-height: 60px; object-fit: contain; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; \" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\r\n                        <span\r\n                            style=\"font-weight: 700; color: var(--clr-accent); font-size: var(--text-xl); letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;\">Al\r\n                            Armain Umrah Transport</span>\r\n                    </a>\r\n                    <p class=\"footer-text\">\r\n                        Get reliable Sedan cars, SUVs, luxury cars, coasters and buses for your Hajj and Umrah journey.\r\n                        Travel in brand-new luxury vehicles with ultimate comfort.\r\n                    </p>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <!-- Quick Links Menu Column -->\r\n                <div class=\"col-lg-2 col-md-6\">\r\n                    <h5 class=\"footer-heading\">Quick Links</h5>